              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Little Southern Mama"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent!! Had intentions of doing on tuna fillets, but ended up not having them and subbing halibut fillets instead - they were exceptional (even our guest thought so)! A keeper!",
            "datePublished": "2008-09-25T08:42:18.357Z"
